  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n- Transitive: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刷|す}る (to print X)\n\nUSAGE:\nIn speech ⟦{印刷|いんさつ}する→印刷する：21677_insatsusuru⟧ is the everyday verb; {刷|す}る is common in publishing and in compounds: {刷|す}り{上|あ}がる (to come off the press), {増刷|ぞうさつ} (reprint), ⟦{版画|はんが}→版画：10582_hanga⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刷|す}る (to print a woodblock).\n\nWATCH OUT:\n⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ is also the verb \"to do\" and {擦|す}る (to rub, to strike a match). In writing the kanji tells them apart; in speech, context does.",
